docs {
  ## Method, Endpoint, and Auth
  
  `DELETE /api/v1/groups/:groupID/invites/:inviteID` — Group owner or site admin; Bearer access token required.
  
  ## Description
  
  Deactivates an invitation link. Repeating the request is safe and returns success.
  
  ## Request
  
  ### Path Parameters
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `groupID` | `integer` | Yes | Positive group ID. |
  | `inviteID` | `integer` | Yes | Positive invitation ID. |
  
  ### Headers
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | `Bearer <access-token>` |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {"success": true, "data": {"message": "group invite deactivated successfully"}}
  ```
  
  ## Errors
  
  - `400 GROUP_INVALID_ID` / `INVITE_INVALID_ID` — Invalid path ID.
  - `401 MISSING_TOKEN` — Access token is missing or invalid.
  - `403 GROUP_OWNER_REQUIRED` — Requester is neither the owner nor an admin.
  - `404 GROUP_NOT_FOUND` — Group does not exist or was deleted.
  - `404 INVITE_NOT_FOUND` — Invitation does not exist in this group.
}
